      <section><h2>Selected experience</h2><div class="cv-entry"><h3>Applied LLM systems</h3><p>Production-oriented NLP and LLM systems for e-commerce operations, spanning RAG, agents, multimodal prototypes and internal AI services.</p></div><div class="cv-entry"><h3>Multi-agent inventory operations</h3><p>Designed a coordinator-led platform with specialist supply, transit and export agents, tool access and explicit confirmation for critical operations.</p></div><div class="cv-entry"><h3>AI transformation</h3><p>Worked on AI-first maturity strategy linking process digitization, decision data, business rules, ML platforms, LLM systems and agents.</p></div></section>
